Description: strongSwan with FortiGate certificate + EAP support (unofficial)
 Unofficial, third-party strongSwan build that connects to FortiGate
 IPsec dial-up VPNs with eap-cert-auth enable (FortiOS 7.4.12/7.6.7+):
 the client certificate is attached to a single EAP-only IKE_AUTH
 round, the flow the FortiGate accepts.
 .
 This metapackage installs the patched daemon stack and the
 NetworkManager plugin providing the "Certificate + EAP
 (Username/Password)" method.  A future official Ubuntu update
 replaces these packages automatically.
 See https://github.com/strongswan/strongswan/issues/3120
